1) Left Shift Operator

>>> bin(255)
'0b11111111'
>>> a=255
>>> b=3
bin(a<<b)
'0b11111111000'

>>> b=7
>>> bin(a<<b)
'0b111111110000000'

note: there is one small formula is there to calcilate left shift operator int value
Givenvalue × 2^(number of bits shifted)


